sequenceDiagram
  actor D as Developer
  participant L as Launcher
  participant S as Boundary
  participant R as Runtime
  participant G as Verification gate

  D->>L: Select profile
  L->>S: Resolve canonical boundary
  alt outside, tied, or symlink escape
    S-->>L: No single owning boundary
    L-->>D: Abort before launch
  else one owning boundary
    S-->>L: Longest matching owner resolved
    L->>R: Prepare runtime
    alt fingerprint changed
      R->>S: Regenerate from source
      S-->>R: Fresh configuration
    else unchanged
      R-->>L: Reuse runtime
    end
    L->>G: Verify configuration and source
    alt pass
      G-->>D: Start AI CLI
    else fail
      G-->>D: Abort before launch
    end
  end
